SUMMARY:Supercharge Your Dissertation
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a workshop where libraries faculty and campus 
 experts share their insights on how to make the most of your dissertation 
 writing.\n\nWhether you’re just about to start working on your 
 dissertation\, or just need a boost\, we want to set you up to get the most 
 out of the summer months.\n\nBagels and coffee will be served.\n\nThis 
 year's schedule:\n\n\n	Establishing a Daily Writing Practice\n	High Impact 
 Publishing Practices\n	Finding and Using Data\n
